    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>ABOUT THE GAME</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Secret Story</strong> is a <strong>first-person &amp; episodic horror &amp; adventure game</strong> that combines immersive storytelling with mysterious events from around the world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Secret Story</strong> is a storytelling game that explores beliefs often at odds with human logic and reasoning. Players will experience real-life stories and events tied to various beliefs around the world, presented through the game's narrative.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will experience</strong>\u00a0sound , sights, tastes, smells, and sounds as if you were truly there. Along the way, you will make critical decisions that determine your fate\u2014leading either to survival or a deadly end through the game's choice-based system!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every choice the player</strong> makes is primarily based on either belief or reason. The game\u2019s narrative will shift depending on each decision made.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Secret Story Chapter 1 \u2013 XIII Phobia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This chapter delves into the story of the number 13, considered a lucky number in Western beliefs. However, on the other side of the world, 13 is associated with misfortune. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the night of Friday the 13th, Henry Caviar was just a traveler seeking relaxation at a hotel. He helped a young woman who warned him about the &quot;ghost hunting day,&quot; leading him to encounter numerous bizarre events that made him feel he had been mistaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics and environmental\u00a0immersive visual experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367740/extras/551ee6aff69f3c6956444287f8745b68.avif?t=1749134775\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person perspective (FPS).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367740/extras/5b771cd4a2d8f45e2bc9258d117f2879.avif?t=1749134775\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in interactions and participate in activities that simulate real-life experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367740/extras/f9fdfef51ccab564f0568c33a836d33f.avif?t=1749134775\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with NPCs to explore deeper connections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply psychological experience that will keep you questioning everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various puzzles and riddles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367740/extras/4cc9a827186b0714aa929233de196bed.avif?t=1749134775\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Key Features Coming Soon - Extended Edition</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome the game through diverse choices. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings await, depending on whether you choose to believe in the story or not.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigame and more Various puzzles and riddles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367740/extras/63c735bca4b332573e9489e4b25a67cb.avif?t=1749134775\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share your haunting experience &amp; provide feedback, suggestions, or bug reports to our team.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367740/extras/f47cd843d464a6ec9f4502c0f8c1fa81.avif?t=1749134775\" width=517 height=111 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367740/extras/c42fffd32e445d074a71c9c5fda160e1.avif?t=1749134775\" width=517 height=111 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367740/extras/acb91be75b83e11bd76247f5975d52b5.avif?t=1749134775\" width=517 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
